  "body": "<!-- openclaw-release-publication:docs-v1 -->\n\n## OpenClaw v2026.9.8\n\n58 commits · 43 pull requests · 21 contributors\n\n### Changes included in this release\n\nThe release notes and changelog contain the same content, presented in two formats:\n\n- [Release notes](https://docs.openclaw.ai/releases/2026.9.8) — formatted for people, with expandable sections.\n- [Changelog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openclaw/openclaw/main/CHANGELOG/2026.9.8.md) — plain Markdown for AI agents and tools.\n\n### Thanks\n\n[@609NFT](https://github.com/609NFT) [@aniketkrs](https://github.com/aniketkrs) [@aniruddhaadak80](https://github.com/aniruddhaadak80) [@EndeavorPioneer](https://github.com/EndeavorPioneer) [@ericcaiwx-star](https://github.com/ericcaiwx-star) [@fuller-stack-dev](https://github.com/fuller-stack-dev) [@hailongguo0530-alt](https://github.com/hailongguo0530-alt) [@jasdeepohri-max](https://github.com/jasdeepohri-max) [@miguelpt2026](https://github.com/miguelpt2026) [@NickM83](https://github.com/NickM83) [@obviyus](https://github.com/obviyus) [@Patrick-Erichsen](https://github.com/Patrick-Erichsen) [@PennyVibe](https://github.com/PennyVibe) [@RomneyDa](https://github.com/RomneyDa) [@scotthuang](https://github.com/scotthuang) [@steipete](https://github.com/steipete) [@VACInc](https://github.com/VACInc) [@vincentkoc](https://github.com/vincentkoc) [@WG-Mojo](https://github.com/WG-Mojo) [@xilopaint](https://github.com/xilopaint) [@yashas-13](https://github.com/yashas-13)\n\n### Release verification\n\n- npm package: https://www.npmjs.com/package/openclaw/v/2026.9.8\n- registry tarball: https://registry.npmjs.org/openclaw/-/openclaw-2026.9.8.tgz\n- integrity: `sha512-G+JkNUhtpDE3cXR4AEi2NyyG9fqI/T2WUSl8ZnR8AATH8Dh1kC3qYFL7wwPoZtgHiP/cszA86PEiE0PDysxb9Q==`\n- release SHA: `fc23bc864e4553c2d215e479eeec47b67a0bf943`\n- full release CI report: https://github.com/openclaw/releases/blob/main/evidence/2026.9.8/release-evidence.md\n- release publish: https://github